"P387556903" "A distress signal has been sent by members of the {VillainGroup} requesting help from anyone.  They claim that {BOSS_NAME} is holding them hostage and is about to kill them. As despicable as the {VillainGroup} is, they don't deserve to be murdered.  This looks like a job for {HeroName}."
// INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1053610053" "Surveilance video shows {BOSS_NAME} dragging a member of the {VillainGroup} towards an abandoned location that you recognize.  Although the {VillainGroup}'s actions are questionable at best, you have a bad feeling about what you saw.  Sometimes even villains need rescuing."
// INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P725241570" "A high ranking member of the {VillainGroup} has recently gone missing.  Additionally, word has it that {BOSS_NAME} has been cranking up their speeches about cleaning up the City lately. Perhaps it might be a good idea to check up on {BOSS_NAME} and see to it that they don't do something they'll regret forever."

